      "decision_canonical_sha256": "16c1792072bb2e9fd64e1ace1ad8fafc79b451388f15e7dc06510c7ccde9c607",
      "status": "approve",
      "reasoning": "The final decision correctly confines Solution C and its concentrated acid to the frozen CultureMech015918 source version. I inspected the complete frozen recipe and current JCM1483 capture: the latter has Solutions A/B and trace elements, without the claimed Solution C. Historical commit231e0ba/PR657 repeats the derived formulation without an independently preserved primary page, so it does not resolve the discrepancy. The final explicit source-reconciliation publication dependency is necessary. A bounded reference to the B concentrated-acid material does not assert current JCM occurrence, numerical assay, solvent or full-formulation equality. All inherited full-owner, quantity and downstream release holds remain.",
